  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 12:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPhoto's from previous marketing\r\n\r\nWelcome to 24 Maraeariki Avenue, Orewa – a modern family home offering comfort, practicality and the relaxed coastal lifestyle Orewa is known for.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2020, this well designed home offers approximately 231m² of floor area on a generous 781m² freehold section.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n\r\n* 4 bedrooms, including 2 ensuites – one upstairs and one downstairs\r\n* 3 bathrooms in total\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Built in 2020 to contemporary building standards\r\n* CV: $1,425,000\r\n\r\nThe flexible layout is ideal for growing families, extended family or those seeking a lifestyle upgrade.\r\n\r\nConveniently located just minutes from Orewa Beach, the vibrant town centre, cafés, shops and local schools, with coastal walks and recreational facilities nearby.\r\n\r\nA wonderful opportunity to enjoy modern family living in one of Auckland’s popular coastal communities.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
